{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":212989,\"title\":\"LEGO Ninjago: Dragons Rising\",\"tagline\":\"A new generation of heroes are rising!\",\"overview\":\"A phenomenon known as the Merge has caused many legendary realms to suddenly combine into one, but their union is unstable. A Spinjitzu Ninja Master must train a new generation of heroes to help find Elemental Dragons who can save the planet before the forces of evil use the same dragon energy to destroy this new world.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5q3tfPVAcL9AlFcb8HXsOdHEtJR.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4vubgrPvqDKNFP1kNvHpd3do9hd.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":8.1,\"voteCount\":115,\"year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action & Adventure\",\"Kids\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":4,\"totalEpisodes\":80,\"createdBy\":[\"Chris Wyatt\",\"Kevin Burke\"],\"networks\":[\"Netflix\",\"Boing\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-09-03\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2191538,\"name\":\"Daniel Ife\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3463080,\"name\":\"Shane Poettcker\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6340406,\"name\":\"Allan Phan\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"nTxmOgv11Ck\",\"name\":\"Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"cypYy-fXaDY\",\"name\":\"Meet the new characters!\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"f_2_3rPKtSE\",\"name\":\"Full Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":214593,\"title\":\"Go for Speed\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hDVcw5gT4vvImS8l2vjpy2mY247.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4232558139534884,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":63350,\"title\":\"Dinotrux\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/grFWAAeKAzJv0ofYNt8g2TcLwey.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40967741935483876,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":283886,\"title\":\"The Roofus\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hLECuV7O6BEY9z0dnDKBmC93elx.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4,\"_genreOverlap\":3},{\"id\":2876,\"title\":\"Ninpuu Sentai Hurricaneger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AWddI4rGUkOTO9HjbrTPeLgKEI.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.3180952380952381,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":32296,\"title\":\"Voltron Force\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pOQ5bfYIEm9Po0KYksPBhVt5tHe.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.28945147679324895,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":63926,\"title\":\"One-Punch Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dT10AxJIXVvRwFAew4tt2RhzJrD.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27614035087719296,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":32037,\"title\":\"Alphablocks\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dppvWTIEUSAKJblYoiRP5Pj59yf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27589743589743587,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":283834,\"title\":\"Belfort & Lupin\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rkjOvFmOzyl9q2skyTCut1IaTNR.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27477477477477474,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":131629,\"title\":\"I Annoyed Millions of Cultivators\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hVoJxzcRgr1f7LldwDUFEPg0vEU.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2734848484848485,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":214594,\"title\":\"Nussa\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9VeojAMJXzo0piifdOQzc5hvlFV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.26666666666666666,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":97598,\"title\":\"Apollo's Great Adventures\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y5iyBRduUYz7s12ziP3T7TD6Xdd.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.26666666666666666,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Wolf-masked warriors. Forbidden fighters. A Blood Moon. Lloyd's dreams may be visions of a startling future — unless the Ninja can rise up and stop it.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pe2gdBRkD84158lHR6bVwVS15BT.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"The Blood Moon\",\"overview\":\"Arin and Sora investigate a mysterious break-in at the junkyard while a sleep-deprived Lloyd suffers from stress dreams about warriors wearing masks.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/abrcMXB1FYdjmUQckNvBcyGiXbO.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":12,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Shattered Dreams\",\"overview\":\"The Ninja interrogate a shifty shopkeeper about a stolen mallet. Could the ancient tool be connected to the Cloud Kingdom archives — and Lloyd's visions?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7LOlTYsRQtzUHX2BoAFyzOVABN9.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Beyond the Phantasm Cave\",\"overview\":\"A metal gate. A teacher. And a direction...? Lloyd experiences a vision from the Source Dragons that sends the Ninja on a righteous but unclear quest.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ajjhvfYIh2mlsUFmCyp4ODmGj34.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Force from the East\",\"overview\":\"To meet the legendary teacher from Lloyd's visions, the Ninja must pass a series of tests. But will the ancient master live up to their expectations?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bPNpJYIczi3qgqzrhDmHtPIIM3i.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Spell at the Waterfall\",\"overview\":\"The Ninja begin their training to defeat the Forbidden Five, but Wyldfyre feels left behind. Bonzle reveals an unexpected connection.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wupUj7bs6REy0X0dXmo59cx7UW6.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"To Mysterium\",\"overview\":\"Bonzle and her team set out to search for a certain sorceress, but first they'll need a map. Meanwhile, Arin struggles with his Spinjitzu training.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hmeBAKYspq6DgYXxbCaqi94XOOy.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Fugitives from Madness\",\"overview\":\"With the Blood Moon looming, Bonzle asks her eccentric creator for help while the Ninja have one last chance to master the Rising Dragon technique.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5o5rmnGHsknenB8h6QjAgBZv0VP.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Secrets of the Wyldness\",\"overview\":\"The Ninja head to the Wyldness, where they must confront Lord Ras — whether they're ready or not. Sorceress reveals her plan for keeping Bonzle safe.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/37MDTK9UUWnTmUC1EGPo5RyOX1o.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Forest of Spirits\",\"overview\":\"Sorceress searches the storehouse for a spell to rescue Bonzle while Arin intercepts a special package. Then, the remaining Ninja infiltrate the ritual.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AksiWgbr4oau5kizGx8lilIwbAn.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":4,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Rising Ninja\",\"overview\":\"With the sacrifices, spell and Blood Moon in his control, Lord Ras has everything he needs to unleash the Forbidden Five — unless the Ninja can act fast!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fMHbSGxYlAcgA7toHxkYM4S8Uow.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"The Shape of Motion\",\"overview\":\"Lloyd attempts to decipher his visions, while Arin uncovers a mysterious theft that threatens the Sixteen Realms while searching for his parents.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qrebHVlwZVr84q31o66VhekJ0IL.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"voteCount\":6,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Enter the City of Temples\",\"overview\":\"The Ninja get a big surprise when they arrive at the Tournament of the Sources, while Kai and Bonzle contend with the Forbidden Five in the Nether-Space.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ukjedUIzg2Pr44fm3u1oVIZARUF.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"They Gather for the Feast\",\"overview\":\"Arin runs into an old friend at the Tournament of the Sources, the Ninja explore the City of Temples, and Lloyd sees a strangely familiar face.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uOB80xqkyRIuCEewSIpy9uw0Abp.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Inside the Maze\",\"overview\":\"Master Wu sets out to discipline the Ninja — through dance! Arin reunites with Frak, who Sora doesn’t trust, and the fighting gets underway.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pRvBoreKpPbXV0I4k9FwZdMysHM.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"United We Fall\",\"overview\":\"Nerves fray and tempers flare as the Ninja prepare to compete. Wyldfyre squares off against Cinder, leading to a serious setback for the gang.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hcAGKd8ueHf6td91mJPF2rvCmvF.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Truth and Lies\",\"overview\":\"As the Ninja fight to win the Temple Race, Ras makes a shocking claim to Arin — putting him at odds with his friends — just as the tournament heats up.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2eFQf25yWfXjkMfGogxm66yKGlB.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"The Sword Shatters\",\"overview\":\"Kai makes a discovery that allows him to speak with his sister. Arin visits the Temple City museum where he has a breakthrough about the missing horns.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iObExJM6Cg73vFwoXg3LhRkGUDL.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Clues and Suspects\",\"overview\":\"Wyldfyre teams up with Arin to find out if Roby is behind the stolen horns. Later, at Bleckt’s office, they make a startling discovery.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fkUxqchig3InBWdbKYbQw0PzP7i.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"The Final Game\",\"overview\":\"Master Wu confirms Arin’s worst fears, and the location of the horns comes to light. Later, Wyldfyre drops a truth bomb at the tournament.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nx47gg6X9Um2ItRisyszntqzG9F.jpg\",\"rating\":9.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Elements of Betrayal\",\"overview\":\"The Wolf Mask army battles the Elemental Masters as the Ninja converge on the Monastery of Gates to stop Nokt from freeing the Forbidden Five.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9bbpBFiEr4jw0TSOgC76Nkz1XoD.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-03\",\"runtime\":23}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2023-06-01\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}